io"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":94,"type":"TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5","pos":[270,-880],"size":[620,680],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"showAdvanced":true,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":261},{"localized_name":"标签","name":"tags","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"tags"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"歌词","name":"lyrics","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"lyrics"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"种子","name":"seed","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"seed"},"link":264},{"localized_name":"每分钟节拍数","name":"bpm","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"bpm"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"时长","name":"duration","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"duration"},"link":268},{"localized_name":"拍号","name":"timesignature","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"timesignature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"语言","name":"language","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"language"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"调式","name":"keyscale","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"keyscale"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"生成音频代码","name":"generate_audio_codes","type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"generate_audio_codes"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"cfg_scale","name":"cfg_scale","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"cfg_scale"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"temperature","name":"temperature","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"temperature"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_p","name":"top_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"top_p"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"top_k","name":"top_k","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"top_k"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"最小 p","name":"min_p","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"min_p"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"条件","name":"CONDITIONING","type":"CONDITIONING","links":[254,255]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.11.1","Node name for S&R":"TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5","enableTabs":false,"tabWidth":65,"tabXOffset":10,"hasSecondTab":false,"secondTabText":"Send Back","secondTabOffset":80,"secondTabWidth":65},"widgets_values":["Ethereal light pastoral new age folk track at 86 BPM, bright warm D major tonality with ultra-spacious valley hall reverb and soft ping delay; core instrumentation includes crystal high-range piano, airy Irish tin whistle, light harp arpeggios, glockenspiel sparse high accents, faint soft violin long string pads, muted high handpan and subtle sand shaker gentle pulse, layered cloud soft synth pad backdrop mixed with distant quiet stream and leaf rustle environmental sampling; zero heavy low-end bass, no punchy drums, only featherlight continuous micro percussion; vocals are soft breathy warm lead with subtle airy ooh backing harmonies, gentle light vocal delay processing; mood is serene, weightless, transcendent, warm mild sunlight bathing empty wide wild nature, cool-warm balanced mild weather, detached from mortal worldly worries like wandering a mistless mountain fairyland; structural arc flows slow ambient atmospheric intro, soft unfolding verses, subtly lifting pre-choruses, full luminous layered choruses, drifting melodic tin whistle interlude, stripped minimal ethereal bridge with reduced percussion, slow fading calm outro, every instrumental layer gradually unfurling then gently receding to preserve boundless empty natural space throughout the composition.\n","[Intro - Misty synth pad slowly fades in, faint stream ambient sound, sporadic glockenspiel single notes, no percussion]\n(Soft distant wordless humming vocals slowly spread out, rustling wind sound layers unfurl gradually)\n[Verse 1 - Crystal piano broken chords, soft shaker weak rhythm, violin long tones lay the background]\n(Slow warm lead vocal delivery, soft and ethereal breath control)\n薄云漫过山脊\n柔光拂过衣袂\n清风携浅草香气\n温度恰好相宜\n俗世喧嚣远去\n天地只剩清寂\n[Pre-Chorus - Harp light arpeggios cut in, tin whistle soft harmony lines rise slightly]\n(Lighter vocal timbre, gentle ascending melody)\n赤脚漫步晴野\n万千烦忧慢慢消解\n暖意裹住躯体\n一身轻盈安宁\n[Chorus - All instrument layers unfold, continuous harp arpeggios, sporadic celesta high notes ornament, soft high-pitched handpan taps, wide spatial ethereal backing vocal pads]\n(Unrestrained, sustained and open vocal tone with wide breath control)\n天光漫遍旷野\n清风渡我忘忧界\n草木轻摇 流云慢曳\n一身暖意 不染尘屑\n踏入这片仙境山野\n万物与我两相和解\n(Soft layered \"ooh\" ethereal backing vocals swell in the middle section then fade gently)\n[Instrumental Interlude - Irish tin whistle solo main melody, sparse piano harmony support, flowing sustained harp, stream ambient sound slightly prominent]\n(No lead vocals, intermittent tiny glockenspiel bell chimes, violin pads maintain soft background texture)\n[Verse 2 - Moderately reduced arrangement, tin whistle plays countermelody behind vocals, shaker maintains faint steady rhythm]\n(Calm, tranquil and mild vocal tone)\n薄雾轻笼晴空\n暖阳抚遍山石丛\n无争无扰无匆忙\n旷野安放我心神\n远离闹市纷扰尘\n此间岁月缓无声\n[Pre-Chorus - Harp arpeggios reappear, rhythm slightly lifts, faint backing vocal hums emerge]\n(Soft ascending vocal melody with mild uplifting emotion)\n赤脚漫步晴野\n万千烦忧慢慢消解\n暖意裹住躯体\n一身轻盈安宁\n[Chorus - Full ethereal arrangement fully open, all core instruments playing together, wide layered \"ooh\" backing vocals, low-volume distant bird chirp samples in background]\n(Unrestrained, sustained and open vocal tone with wide breath control)\n天光漫遍旷野\n清风渡我忘忧界\n草木轻摇 流云慢曳\n一身暖意 不染尘屑\n踏入这片仙境山野\n万物与我两相和解\n(Soft layered \"ooh\" ethereal backing vocals swell in the middle section then fade gently)\n[Bridge - Extremely minimal ethereal arrangement, all percussion removed, only crystal piano harmonics, misty synth pads, guzheng harmonic ornaments, faint violin long tones retained]\n(Near-whisper vocal delivery, heavy spacious reverb with large empty audio space)\n抛开俗世千缕牵绊\n静坐流云漫卷山畔\n不寒不燥天光漫漫\n心神随云自在飘散\n(Fading echoing \"ah\" vocal phrases inserted between lines, dissipate slowly)\n[Outro - Instruments fade layer by layer, harp fades out first, followed by tin whistle, celesta, violin pads; only sparse piano high notes, misty synth pads, faint stream sound remain]\n(Distant soft humming \"mm\" vocals dissipate slowly along with reverb, all sounds gradually fade to silent empty space for ending)",0,"fixed",70,120,"4","zh","E minor",true,2,0.85,1,0,0]}],"links":[[119,47,0,3,2,"CONDITIONING"],[175,78,0,3,0,"MODEL"],[249,98,0,3,3,"LATENT"],[254,94,0,3,1,"CONDITIONING"],[255,94,0,47,0,"CONDITIONING"],[256,3,0,18,0,"LATENT"],[260,104,0,78,0,"MODEL"],[261,105,0,94,0,"CLIP"],[262,106,0,18,1,"VAE"],[264,109,0,94,3,"INT"],[265,109,0,3,4,"INT"],[266,111,2,112,0,"AUDIO"],[267,18,0,111,0,"AUDIO"],[268,113,0,94,5,"FLOAT"],[269,113,0,98,0,"FLOAT"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"Model","bounding":[-210,-950,447.22598026477124,574.6629131689834],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"Prompt","bounding":[260,-950,640,960],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}}],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1.2349994480014765,"offset":[-222.84496367176968,1060.037778599747]},"frontendVersion":"1.41.21","workflowRendererVersion":"LG","VHS_latentpreview":false,"VHS_latentpreviewrate":0,"VHS_MetadataImage":true,"VHS_KeepIntermediate":true},"version":0.4}